                        ],
                        "form": "двуко́лках"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c109aca5-259b-3c2e-8558-c23c2596d3b2",
                        "entry_id": "e63bea11-7bf9-3365-a702-81ca0cc6a109",
                        "glosses": [
                            "двухколёсная повозка"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c1210f6f-660d-431c-b79c-b9edffbcee28",
                                "sense_id": "c109aca5-259b-3c2e-8558-c23c2596d3b2",
                                "text": "Утром после кофе поехали вдвоём кататься в двуколке."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7ebcc8ad-eed5-4c0d-981a-6a04d548172d",
                                "sense_id": "c109aca5-259b-3c2e-8558-c23c2596d3b2",
                                "text": "Никите было предложено: если он хочет ехать к заутрене, пусть разыщет Артёма и скажет, чтобы заложили в двуколку кобылу Афродиту, она кована на все четыре ноги."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c7ba491d-d3fb-42bb-aad8-e6dcff1b73dd",
                        "source_entry_id": "e63bea11-7bf9-3365-a702-81ca0cc6a109",
                        "source_sense_id": "c109aca5-259b-3c2e-8558-c23c2596d3b2",
                        "target_lang_word": "two-wheeled cart",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1936dc1f-e90b-4a8e-bede-9985a6b34f37",
                        "source_entry_id": "e63bea11-7bf9-3365-a702-81ca0cc6a109",
                        "source_sense_id": "c109aca5-259b-3c2e-8558-c23c2596d3b2",
                        "target_lang_word": "hansom",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hansom",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "45a7a9f6-0140-358b-95fc-12cd6b0e605f",
                                        "entry_id": "87a7bfcf-2620-3cf3-a05f-d7fc89de3287",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ellipsis of Hansom cab."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "abbreviation",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "ellipsis",
                                            "historical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "548a0292-eda0-45c3-9ad9-c42e6b7b39e9",
                                                "sense_id": "45a7a9f6-0140-358b-95fc-12cd6b0e605f",
                                                "text": "I rose accordingly from table, got into a hansom, and drove straight to Jekyll's house."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac1347c8-ac0c-4a5b-9433-7e6d25f0a6c0",
                                                "sense_id": "45a7a9f6-0140-358b-95fc-12cd6b0e605f",
                                                "text": "\"Yes, if you have nothing better to do.\" A minute later we were both in a hansom, driving furiously for the Brixton Road."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "00277c1b-0d02-48a3-ac04-56168b68ad3e",
                                                "sense_id": "45a7a9f6-0140-358b-95fc-12cd6b0e605f",
                                                "text": "“There the cause of death was soon ascertained ; the victim of this daring outrage had been stabbed to death from ear to ear with a long, sharp instrument, in shape like an antique stiletto, which […] was subsequently found under the cushions of the hansom.[…]”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4299dbf9-ce03-4049-bb0c-9abf2bfcc8f6",
                                                "sense_id": "45a7a9f6-0140-358b-95fc-12cd6b0e605f",
                                                "text": "The shooting motor cars, more like spiders in the moon than terrestrial objects, the thundering drays, the jingling hansoms, and little black broughams, made her think of the world she lived in."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "67f37fa1-2b78-4f81-a0f4-5603fae841a3",
                                                "sense_id": "45a7a9f6-0140-358b-95fc-12cd6b0e605f",
                                                "text": "The ghost of Selby stirred in him. His thoughts slipped back to the day when he had stolen from his well-appointed office to a waiting hansom—there had still been a good many hansoms in those days—and driven quickly to the docks."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3829ef3e-8c7a-48c0-bdc2-48c859dc7438",
                        "source_entry_id": "e63bea11-7bf9-3365-a702-81ca0cc6a109",
                        "source_sense_id": "c109aca5-259b-3c2e-8558-c23c2596d3b2",
                        "target_lang_word": "carriole",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "carriole",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "24f6a70b-e376-3819-99fd-59dca71fff46",
                                        "entry_id": "0bdc2a17-f0ae-3207-8a61-1186cc9db20b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Petite charrette couverte et grossièrement suspendue."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6c3f96ac-60f4-4325-9c33-f69c34868216",
                                                "sense_id": "24f6a70b-e376-3819-99fd-59dca71fff46",
                                                "text": "On voit passer quantité de petites carrioles qui portent un jeune homme et une jeune fille; […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e129eae-bc7d-4ea5-a076-2174987d81c0",
                                                "sense_id": "24f6a70b-e376-3819-99fd-59dca71fff46",
                                                "text": "J'avais laissé Reykjavik, un grand village ; […] ; des poneys et une ou deux mauvaises carrioles assuraient le transport."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25d7ef63-d5a0-417d-8f88-d8e964685c79",
                                                "sense_id": "24f6a70b-e376-3819-99fd-59dca71fff46",
                                                "text": "On avait beau le corriger quand les voisins le ramenait en carriole, l'habitude de ces fugues était prise."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dd1d41d3-6ed7-3c7f-829d-fbf49aae010e",
                                        "entry_id": "0bdc2a17-f0ae-3207-8a61-1186cc9db20b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Tout attelage tiré par un animal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d12ff4d-a0e4-4915-9390-74a15f48b0cd",
                                                "sense_id": "dd1d41d3-6ed7-3c7f-829d-fbf49aae010e",
                                                "text": "Ça ne vient pas de Pontaven, dit Alain. Je connais tous les loueurs du bourg et je ne leur ai jamais vu cette carriole-là. C'est de Lorient ou de Vannes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a27abaf0-6e65-4f53-9f11-2124270cfa32",
                                                "sense_id": "dd1d41d3-6ed7-3c7f-829d-fbf49aae010e",
                                                "text": "L’homme et la femme en haillons, trempés jusqu’aux os, suivaient la carriole, dont la toile oscillait sur des cerceaux d’osier. Des têtes d’enfants, ébouriffées, sortaient des ouvertures de la maison roulante."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c93bd96c-0dd6-4ec5-b41e-a3facc3f3c8d",
                                                "sense_id": "dd1d41d3-6ed7-3c7f-829d-fbf49aae010e",
                                                "text": "De tous les pays circonvoisins, des campagnes et des villes, malades et infirmes, paralytiques, culs-de-jatte et pieds-bots accouraient dans des carrioles, dans des calèches, sur des ânes, sur leurs moignons calleux."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a132a0c3-9f4f-4e9a-a757-f3081aa5b7e9",
                                                "sense_id": "dd1d41d3-6ed7-3c7f-829d-fbf49aae010e",
                                                "text": "Et les deux carrioles, haut perchées sur des roues sans ressort, partirent au trot, l'une à droite, l'autre à gauche, secouant et ballotant à chaque cahot des grandes ornières ces restes d'êtres qui s'étaient étreints et qui ne se rencontreraient plus."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec79072b-625b-456e-a4a4-5d6312adf0a8",
                                                "sense_id": "dd1d41d3-6ed7-3c7f-829d-fbf49aae010e",
                                                "text": "Par un grand jour de pluie, une carriole avait conduit le cercueil depuis la maison de Borderouge."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "carriole",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
